# module test: build with EW_APPS=motion
# Motion LM speed on the device: 480 forward passes of the motion LM on the
# engine task (core 0). The log line carries us_per_fwd and tok_s.
# In ewsimrec the number is meaningless (host CPU time is free): run on the watch.
goto Motion
raw motion bench 480
expect log MOTION:.bench.n=480 15000
show bench
raw motion
show motion:
